# Keep Lambda deployment packages to just src/ + requirements deps.
# CodeUri is the repo root (so `src` is an importable package matching `from src.common ...`
# and handlers like `src.collector.handler.handler`); everything below is pruned from the zip.
.venv/
.git/
.github/
tests/
infra/
docs/
aws/
policies/
scripts/
# config/: the YAML registries are dev-only (production reads /jprs/companies from SSM), but the
# JSON projections ARE read at runtime by the report Lambda — the candidate-policy projection and
# the application-history projection. Excluding the whole directory shipped a Lambda where history
# lookups silently returned NEW for everything, so only the YAML is pruned.
config/*.yaml
config/*.yml
project-factory/
codex-skills/
_template_archive/
jprs.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.md
.gitignore
.samignore
.claude/
.cursor/
.pytest_cache/
.aws-sam/
.DS_Store
Makefile
LICENSE
CODEOWNERS
CONTRIBUTING.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
BUILD_LOG.md
START_HERE.md
